        <mxCell id="c139" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the net cash from operating activities, coral for 2026 (adjusted, then as recorded) and teal for 2025. Each pair is equal, so row 86 reads a dash: no adjustment moves cash, though the lines above the total differ. The change in cash of (941,310.30) in 2026 agrees with the balance sheets (row 85), and a zero is shown as a dash, as the workbook&#x27;s number format does.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="619" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
